  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Interfaith Rainforest Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Interfaith Rainforest initiative aims to bring moral attention and spiritual commitment to ending tropical deforestation. The initiative mobilizes religious and faith-based leaders and communities around the world to take concrete action to protect, restore and sustainably manage the worlds rainforests.</narrative>
  </description>
